                "name": "Implement all the various state transition plane hooks",
                "description_json": {},
                "description_html": "<h1 class=\"editor-heading-block\" data-id=\"e0656428-64f1-4dc1-bbb1-98c512513b26\">State Transition Plane Hooks</h1><blockquote data-id=\"4d010402-939c-46a8-a37c-f2114f9f5632\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"a604dbbd-ae8b-4cfa-8523-ed6f2d27473e\">Note</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"72dfe826-b010-4627-b09b-2c5b77fd1288\">Not as simple as <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">state(action) = state`</code>. </p></blockquote><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"b50b0037-f217-4ac3-8aa5-1daad6524d02\">For example:<br><br><code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">state(scope:action) → state` == state|scope:substate</code></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"c756edf4-5d51-4525-8c9b-c2d578d1a2f6\">A tickets in some state <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">S</code> when applied to some action <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">A</code> transitions to a new state <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">S`</code>where <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">S`</code>in</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y) tight\" data-id=\"5d288559-755f-46d0-8719-43b21f9680ba\" data-tight=\"true\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"9210d713-9899-43fc-b8b4-137f7b30c820\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"521e9017-047e-481a-908d-0c0095389141\">Any state that is <em>not</em> <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">S</code></p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"1b39a56e-54a1-4952-9136-3d628ad7227d\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"37bb1fcc-c3b7-44de-b28b-90307fd948b6\"><code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">S</code>with a new or modified<code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">scoped substate label</code> </p></li></ul><pre class=\"\" data-id=\"16c9df61-bece-4c0a-b4c6-1beecb184733\"><code>New Ticket → Todo\nTodo(workflow:triage) → Todo|lifecycle:triaged\nTodo|lifecycle:triaged(agent:claim) → In Progress\nIn Progress(task:complete) → E2E Test\nE2E Test(agent:claim) → E2E|lifecycle:testing\n....</code></pre><h2 class=\"editor-heading-block\" data-id=\"1fba9b6b-f7da-4aa0-b168-7843692edd00\">AC</h2><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y) tight\" data-id=\"7cfcaa41-8ce5-4dd8-b7d7-941877152cb1\" data-tight=\"true\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"f5b201ab-acb8-41e8-908f-dbdc2f6019a9\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"6c1acb0e-6f19-4011-9183-b3420b3b17cf\">All possible transitions according to the Krebs lifecycle schema enumerated</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"65f2fb8d-487d-439e-b7be-0c913bd5e780\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"77d60ea6-b7c0-418e-b354-6790a29074ed\">Full Krebs ticket lifecycle state transition diagram created in <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">~/code/33GOD/krebs/std.mermaid.md</code> and <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">~/code/33GOD/krebs/std.excalidraw</code></p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"ff3bef8d-e074-4558-b059-4eacf9700809\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"a539f79a-89d1-4877-91a3-5ffeee5b42d1\">Each transition fires a unique <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">bloodbank.lifecycle</code>fanout event</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"d4733e14-8918-43ec-a91e-19e56112be52\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"41045db4-4cce-43e7-981b-c41c97789e76\">Each mutation can be traced back to a bloodbank command payload with the exception being a manual update</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"4eff07dc-4fc9-4438-87ca-b075180b9a8d\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"f97ae116-d0b7-42ce-ac42-19fac9d79c20\">The full story/history of a ticket can be tracked throughout it's entire lifecycle from <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">initial creation</code> to either <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">complete</code> or <code class=\"rounded-sm bg-layer-3 px-[6px] py-[1.5px] font-code font-medium text-(--extended-color-orange-600) border-[0.5px] border-subtle\" spellcheck=\"false\">canceled</code></p></li></ol>",
                "description_stripped": "State Transition Plane HooksNoteNot as simple as state(action) = state`. For example:state(scope:action) → state` == state|scope:substateA tickets in some state S when applied to some action A transitions to a new state S`where S`inAny state that is not SSwith a new or modifiedscoped substate label New Ticket → Todo\nTodo(workflow:triage) → Todo|lifecycle:triaged\nTodo|lifecycle:triaged(agent:claim) → In Progress\nIn Progress(task:complete) → E2E Test\nE2E Test(agent:claim) → E2E|lifecycle:testing\n....ACAll possible transitions according to the Krebs lifecycle schema enumeratedFull Krebs ticket lifecycle state transition diagram created in ~/code/33GOD/krebs/std.mermaid.md and ~/code/33GOD/krebs/std.excalidrawEach transition fires a unique bloodbank.lifecyclefanout eventEach mutation can be traced back to a bloodbank command payload with the exception being a manual updateThe full story/history of a ticket can be tracked throughout it's entire lifecycle from initial creation to either complete or canceled",
